===Etymology===
From {{etyl|yue|en}} {{term|鬼佬||tr=gweilo|lang=yue|foreign devil}}, from {{term|鬼||lang=yue|ghost}} + {{term|佬||lang=yue|a regular guy, a chap}} {{attention|yue|transcriptions}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|ethnic slur|lang=en}} A [[w:Caucasian race|Caucasian]] person, in China (generally a man); a ‘foreign devil’.
